          "block_id": "tile_pandas_descriptive_stats.r01.b1",
          "role": "definition",
          "text": "`describe()` computes a set of summary statistics — count, mean, std, min, quartiles (25%, 50%, 75%), and max — for a Series or for each numeric column of a DataFrame in one call. The `50%` row is the median. For the SwiftDrop delivery-time column (all fourteen orders), `describe()` shows count 14, mean 29.0, std 15.6, min 18, 25% 21.25, 50% (median) 25.0, 75% 30.25, and max 80.",
